one, so this is love without borders.' So the divine will gave a place to everyone in

38
00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:14.200
my arms, so all souls were placed in Jesus. He's the one who determines what happens to

39
00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:23.600
them eternally. Now the supreme will, sorry, now, the supreme will is a continuous act

40
00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:31.880
never interrupted. And what the divine will does once, it never ceases doing. And even

41
