though my humanity is in heaven and is not subject to suffering now, it keeps searching

42
00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:46.720
for souls who do not move in the human will, but in the divine, and who oppose nothing.

43
00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:53.440
Souls who would lose all their rights so that the right being holy of the divine will,

44
