00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:56.000
It's fantastic. Therefore, be attentive. Leave all rights to the Supreme will. And Jesus

106
00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:01.840
said, "I will keep forming in you the sanctity of living in the divine will." This is something

107
00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:09.720
that goes on 24/7, 365. It goes on all the time. It doesn't break. It doesn't stop just

