fear. Naturally, it's sovereign. On the contrary, my will is confident of itself and it is unshakeable.

141
00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:38.160
And more. You must know that as the soul decides to let herself be possessed by my will and

142
00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:43.840
to live in it, since my will is linked with all created things and there's nothing over

