00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:06.400
suffers enough from all the evil that goes on on the earth. And while he was saying this,

155
00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:10.360
Louisa looked into the heavens and into the sun and to all the rest and she could see

156
00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:18.920
her name written with the title of daughter of the divine will. May everything she said

157
00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:25.440
be for the glory of God. This reminds me of an incident in St. Therese's life when she

158
00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:35.640
was walking with her father and she looked up and she saw tea in the sky, tea for Therese.

159
00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:41.000
One day I was walking and talking to the Lord and I said, "I bet anything my name isn't

160
00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:47.320
written in the sky." I understand Louisa seeing her name into great things and I understand

161
00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:53.640
Therese seeing tea in the sky and with the marvelous humor with which the Lord has dealt

162
00:20:53.640 --> 00:21:00.520
with me all my life, he said, "No, your name's in the gutter." And I looked down and there

163
00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:08.520
at my feet was a fire hydrant with the two letters F-H and I just laughed. And ever since

164
00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:12.920
I've said to him, "I know I'm one of the ones that have to live in the gutter. I have

165
00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:17.920
to live in the nothing because I don't have a chance at all if I don't stay in the nothing.

166
00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:24.440
So I don't mind it at all and I don't even mind walking over the fire hydrant and putting

167
00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:32.720
my foot on the F-H. I don't mind at all." So some people see their names or their letter

168
00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:40.280
in the sky and some of us are from a much more lowly place altogether.

169
00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:48.640
So August the 9th, 1924, "Praying, suffering and working in the divine will are the only

